# Gmail
IMAPAccount gmail
Host imap.gmail.com
User martbari.g@gmail.com
PassCmd "gpg --quiet --for-your-eyes-only --no-tty --decrypt ~/.authinfo.gpg | awk '/machine imap.gmail.com/ {print $6}'"
SSLTYPE IMAPS
AuthMechs LOGIN

IMAPStore gmail-remote
Account gmail

MaildirStore gmail-local
Path ~/.mail/gmail/
Inbox ~/.mail/gmail/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel gmail
Far :gmail-remote:
Near :gmail-local:
Patterns *
Create Near
SyncState *

# Zmail
IMAPAccount zmail
Host zmail.ibpc.fr
User bari-garnier@ibpc.fr
PassCmd "gpg --quiet --for-your-eyes-only --no-tty --decrypt ~/.authinfo.gpg | awk '/machine zmail.ibpc.fr/ {print $6}'"
TLSType IMAPS
AuthMechs LOGIN

IMAPStore zmail-remote
Account zmail

MaildirStore zmail-local
Path ~/.mail/zmail/
Inbox ~/.mail/zmail/INBOX
SubFolders Verbatim

Channel zmail
Far :zmail-remote:
Near :zmail-local:
Patterns * !drafts !sent !trash
# Patterns *
Create Near
SyncState *
